  "beats": [
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "In a fictional Android Open Source Project lab, Isha's test phone refuses a rebuilt image. Kai turns the terminal toward the boot metadata.",
      "visuals": [
        {
          "do": "layout",
          "template": "board-full"
        },
        {
          "do": "term.type",
          "id": "local-check",
          "cmd": "avbtool verify_image --image vbmeta.img --key test.pem",
          "out": "Illustrative local check: signature valid under supplied key"
        },
        {
          "do": "define",
          "term": "AOSP"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "rookie",
      "text": "My signature verifies with test dot pem. That means this device trusts the image, right?",
      "say": "My signature verifies with test dot pem. That means this device trusts the image, right?",
      "visuals": [
        {
          "do": "sketch.note",
          "id": "claim",
          "text": "MYTH: valid signature = device trust"
        },
        {
          "do": "sketch.note",
          "id": "lab-label",
          "text": "Fictional lab key names; no device output claimed"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "senior",
      "text": "That's the myth. Android Verified Boot, AVB, checks whether the bootloader accepts the public key that signed vbmeta. Valid math under another key does not establish device trust.",
      "visuals": [
        {
          "do": "layout",
          "template": "board-full"
        },
        {
          "do": "seq.diagram",
          "id": "trust",
          "actors": [
            "Bootloader",
            "vbmeta",
            "Images"
          ],
          "messages": [
            {
              "from": "Bootloader",
              "to": "vbmeta",
              "label": "accept public key?"
            },
            {
              "from": "vbmeta",
              "to": "Images",
              "label": "descriptors"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "define",
          "term": "AVB"
        },
        {
          "do": "sketch.note",
          "id": "reveal-note",
          "text": "Trust depends on accepted key"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "rookie",
      "text": "Okay, but if the accepted key matches, every older image should boot?",
      "visuals": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "senior",
      "text": "A second gate can still stop it. AVB compares each rollback index in vbmeta with the device's stored value; a lower index is rejected even when signature checks pass.",
      "visuals": [
        {
          "do": "layout",
          "template": "board-full"
        },
        {
          "do": "clear",
          "keep": [
            "trust"
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "timeline.track",
          "id": "rollback",
          "lanes": [
            "Image metadata",
            "Device state",
            "Decision"
          ],
          "span": [
            0,
            100
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "lane": "Image metadata",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 60,
              "label": "rollback index"
            },
            {
              "lane": "Device state",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 60,
              "label": "stored index"
            },
            {
              "lane": "Decision",
              "start": 60,
              "end": 100,
              "label": "reject"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "sketch.note",
          "id": "reveal-note",
          "text": "Lower rollback index is rejected"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "At the fictional bench, Isha compares the signing key and rollback policy before touching the test phone again.",
      "visuals": [
        {
          "do": "layout",
          "template": "board-full"
        },
        {
          "do": "term.type",
          "id": "inspect",
          "cmd": "avbtool info_image --image vbmeta.img",
          "out": "Illustrative inspection: check descriptors, key and rollback metadata"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "rookie",
      "text": "I'll verify the descriptor chain, use the key this test device is configured to accept, and compare rollback state before flashing. The signature alone was never the whole answer.",
      "visuals": [
        {
          "do": "layout",
          "template": "board-full"
        },
        {
          "do": "tree",
          "id": "checklist",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "id": "meta",
              "label": "VBMeta"
            },
            {
              "id": "key",
              "label": "Key",
              "parent": "meta"
            },
            {
              "id": "chain",
              "label": "Chain",
              "parent": "meta"
            },
            {
              "id": "rollback",
