          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "key_points": [
    "A valid signature proves signing under a key; device trust depends on the bootloader accepting that key.",
    "Signed vbmeta descriptors bind or delegate verification for partition images.",
    "Rollback protection can reject an old image even when its signature is valid."
  ],
